  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Depending the system configuration, trying to deploy the new 4.7.5 to a tomcat container can cause a NullPointerException.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is because Narayana reads the objectStore directory from a jbossts-properties.xml file or uses user.home by default.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If your Tomcat user doesn't have a home directory or doesn't have write persmission this results in an error.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
