  "description": "<p>Depending the system configuration, trying to deploy the new 4.7.5 to a tomcat container can cause a NullPointerException.</p>\n\n<p>This is because Narayana reads the objectStore directory from a jbossts-properties.xml file or uses user.home by default.</p>\n\n<p>If your Tomcat user doesn't have a home directory or doesn't have write persmission this results in an error.</p>",
